<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia records trade surplus in June.</title>
<headline>Malaysia records trade surplus in June.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia recorded a trade surplus of 574 million ringgit in June, against a 238.2 million surplus in May, the Statistics Department said.</p>
<p>			 MALAYSIA TRADE BALANCE</p>
<p>			 (in billions of ringgit)</p>
<p>			     June 1996    May 1996	June 1995</p>
<p>Merchandise balance    +574 million     +238.2 million    -2,121 million</p>
<p>Exports		    16.3	   16.99	   15.62</p>
<p>Imports		    15.7	   16.75	   17.74</p>
